However all this does is provide privacy for personal data and 
communications - it still doesn't help mitigate the threat of possible news 
censorship... the only alternative is for anyone who wants an unlimited 
newsfeed to bring it in in encrypted form from the US, which is 
prohibitively expensive.

Oh yes, I don't speak for the Uni of Auckland, and YMMV on the above 
